    },
    "description": "Changes a deal (\`dealId\`, \`expectedVersion\` from get_pipeline). \`move_stage\` moves it to \`stageId\`, with an optional \`lostReason\` for a Lost stage; \`edit\` changes \`title\`, \`ownerId\` (a user id or null), \`amount\` with \`currency\`, or \`expectedCloseOn\` (YYYY-MM-DD or null). Someone else's change since then answers \`stale_version\` with the current version.",
